 # Changelog
 
+## 0.2.1-enxoo.1 — local preflight fixes (2026-11-06)
+
+Local maintenance build on top of upstream `v0.2.0`; not an upstream release.
+Only `advisor-capability-preflight` changes (skill version `1.1.0`); no partner
+advisory instructions or domain references change.
+
+### Fixed
+- `check_preflight.py` no longer reports maintainer-listed install candidates as
+  verified. `verified_install_candidates` is removed; each entry in
+  `listed_install_candidates` carries `verification` (`not_performed`, or
+  `declared_by_runtime_catalog` for a runtime catalog entry marked verified).
+  The output `schema_version` is now 2.
+- A missing or invalid documentation policy returns `policy_status`
+  `missing`/`invalid`, MCP status `unknown`, `ready: false`, and
+  `advisory_ready: true` instead of raising `KeyError`. Unreadable saved choices
+  produce a warning instead of an exception.
+- Documentation consent records the exact approved hosts and URL prefixes
+  (`--approved-host`, `--approved-url-prefix`). The check reports the approved
+  scope and flags entries outside the policy; it never widens a narrowed
+  approval. Records without a scope keep their meaning: the full policy list.
+- The policy allows a read-only re-read of the install candidate's listing page
+  (`provenance_review`). `policy_version` is now `2026-11-06`, so saved choices
+  from `2026-07-31` need one reconfirmation.
+- `harness-setup.md` covers Claude Code cloud sessions: connector or committed
+  `.mcp.json` routes, temporary containers, network policy, and host fetch
+  tools that can change during a session.
+
 ## 0.2.0 — Beta (2026-11-04)
 
 - Promote the tested portability candidate to a normal SemVer release; Beta
